nftban (1.29.3-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * v1.29.3 — UI Security, Module Viewers, Packaging Fixes
  * Security: VULN-03 (session fixation) and VULN-12 (CSRF) fixes in UI
  * UI: 8 module viewer pages (DDoS, Portscan, Login, Suricata, etc.)
  * UI: 8-page UX improvements with consistent layouts
  * Packaging: postinst FHS/ACL fixes for fresh install
  * Packaging: templ generate integrated into DEB/RPM builds
  * Fix: P0 fresh install lockout — missing nftables.conf SSH_PORT substitution
  * Systemd: sd_notify/WatchdogSec support for nftband
  * Systemd: SecurityHardening directives for all long-running services

