  * v1.29.0 — RBL Correctness, Security Hardening, CI Fixes
  * RBL: Fix default state mismatch, LOG_DIR self-reference, trap collision
  * RBL: Enhanced status output, --brief flag, dedicated log file, health checks
  * Security: 12 vulnerability fixes (VULN-01,02,04,05,13,19,20 + WI-3 + S2 + B5)
  * Security: Log injection sanitization (pkg/logutil) across 15 Go files
  * Security: API error sanitization (sanitizeError/sanitizeErrorMsg)
  * CLI: Trust and botguard stats/config subcommands
  * Go: 65+ timeout constants extracted to pkg/constants/timeouts.go
